      "name": "Back Kick",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The augdunar whirls around, delivering a powerful kick with both its hind legs. The augdunar makes a hoof Strike. If the Strike hits, the augdunar deals an extra 1d10 bludgeoning damage. This counts as two attacks when calculating the augdunar's multiple attack penalty.</p>",
